<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge falls to 75.6000 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge falls to 75.6000 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge closed at 75.6000 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Wednesday after 75.5300 on Tuesday.</p>
<p> TENGE PER DOLLAR	     June 11		 June 10</p>
<p> High			     75.6302		 75.6300</p>
<p> Low				75.4501		 75.4000</p>
<p> Open			     75.5000		 75.6000</p>
<p> Close			    75.6000		 75.5300</p>
<p> Volume ($ mln)		  1.865		   3.880</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, + 7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
